{"name":"Downwell","hex":"#001100","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"downwell","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To sink below material of lower density.","To penetrate water downward."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A vertical shaft or well in which water flows downward.","Synonym of downwelling."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/downwell"}],"entries":[{"title":"Downwell (video game)","blocks":[{"text":"Downwell is a 2015 roguelike vertically scrolling shooter video game developed by Moppin and published by Devolver Digital. The first game to be developed solely by Ojiro Fumoto, it was released for iOS and Microsoft Windows in October 2015, for Android in January 2016, and for PlayStation 4 and PlayStation Vita in May 2016. A Nintendo Switch version was released in January 2019. British studio Red Phantom Games developed the Switch and PlayStation ports."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/3/30/Downwell_logo.png/330px-Downwell_logo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Downwell_(video_game)","wikidata":"Q21198154"},{"title":"Downwelling","blocks":[{"text":"Downwelling is the downward movement of a fluid parcel and its properties within a larger fluid. It is closely related to upwelling, the upward movement of fluid."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/17/Coastal_Downwelling.png/330px-Coastal_Downwelling.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Downwelling","wikidata":"Q2315892"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/ca/Downwell_screenshot.png/330px-Downwell_screenshot.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/ca/Downwell_screenshot.png/330px-Downwell_screenshot.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign